        "subject": "LU-20423 nrs: check LRU hit using the wrong TBF class bucket",
        "message": "LU-20423 nrs: check LRU hit using the wrong TBF class bucket\n\nIn the nrs_tbf_cli_findadd(), when found a matched class bucket\nfrom the hash table but with zero refcount, it should continue to\ncheck LRU whether it is in LRU list or not.\nBut the current code uses the wrong class bucket to check LRU,\nit should use the right class bucket which is found from the hash\ntable.\n\nFixes: 698e25c27e (\"LU-19597 tbf: remove the redundant codes\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=77\nChange-Id: If6c14411eea38e97cab85b8bca4a0467a1078f55\nSigned-off-by: Yingjin Qian <qian@ddn.com>\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66827\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Etienne AUJAMES <eaujames@ddn.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
